<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.10.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02247</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.10.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>f62c897b-620d-4185-9108-9e8a59067698</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><emphasis><emphasis>
    <para>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</para>
  </emphasis></emphasis>
<para>For questions 1–4, find the factored form of the quadratic expression.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(3x^2+ 16x + 5\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((3x − 5)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x + 1)(x - 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x − 1)(x − 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x + 1)(x + 5)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((3x + 1)(x + 5)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(2x^2+ 11x − 6\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((2x + 6)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 6)(x + 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 1)(x + 6)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x + 1)(x − 6)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((2x − 1)(x + 6)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4x^2− 13x + 3\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((4x − 1)(x − 3)\) </item>
  <item> \((4x + 3)(x + 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((4x − 3)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((4x + 1)(x + 3)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((4x − 1)(x − 3)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(2x^2−3x −2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((2x + 1)(x − 2)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x + 2)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 2)(x + 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 1)(x + 2)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((2x + 1)(x − 2)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>The height, in meters, of a baseball being hit is modeled by the function \(h(x) = -2x^2+ 12x + 3\) where \(x\) is the number of seconds since being hit.</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 4.38 seconds </item>
  <item> 6.24 seconds </item>
  <item> 7.26 seconds </item>
  <item> 7.56 seconds </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 6.24 seconds</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>The height, in meters, of a roller coaster is modeled by the function \(h(x) = -2x^2 + 20x + 5\) where \(x\) is the number of seconds after starting.</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 5.221 seconds </item>
  <item> 7.963 seconds </item>
  <item> 8.365 seconds </item>
  <item> 10.244 seconds </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> 10.244 seconds</para>
<para>For questions 7–10, find the factored form of the quadratic expression.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(3x^2 + 2x − 5\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((3x + 5)(x + 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((x + 5)(3x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x + 5)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x − 5)(x + 1)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((3x + 5)(x − 1)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4x^2+ 4x − 15\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((4x − 3)(x + 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 3)(2x + 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((4x + 3)(x − 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x + 3)(2x − 5)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((2x − 3)(2x + 5)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(5x^2− 39x − 8\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((5x − 1)(x + 8)\) </item>
  <item> \((5x + 8)(x − 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((5x − 8)(x + 1)\) </item>
  <item> \((5x + 1)(x − 8)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((5x + 1)(x − 8)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(6x^2+ 53x − 9\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((6x − 1)(x + 9)\) </item>
  <item> \((3x − 1)(2x + 9)\) </item>
  <item> \((2x − 1)(3x + 9)\) </item>
  <item> \((6x + 1)(x − 9)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((6x − 1)(x + 9)\)</para></section>
</content>
